config BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_ALLWINNER_UTILS
    bool "host allwinner-utils"
    help
      Allwinner utilities for building boot images and environment.
      
      This package provides build tools for Allwinner platforms:
      - dragonsecboot: Tool for packing boot components into boot_package.fex
      - u_boot_env_gen: Tool for generating U-Boot environment partitions
      
      These are host tools used during the build process.
      
      https://github.com/knulli-cfw/hdzero-goggle-tools